(SECTION II - BIDDER STATUTORY & FINANCIAL QUALIFICATION) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 720 Td
20 TL
(1. The bidder must possess a valid GST registration. Copies of Form GST REG-06 and latest return filings must be uploaded.) '
(2. Copy of Permanent Account Number \(PAN\) Card issued by Income Tax Department must be furnished. Compliance with Section 206AB mandatory.) '
(3. Bidder shall submit Certificate of Incorporation and valid CIN active on MCA portal.) '
(4. The minimum average annual financial turnover of the bidder during the last three years ending 31st March must be 5.00 Crore.) '
(5. The bidder must have successfully executed similar supply orders with at least 5 years experience in manufacturing valves.) '
ET

endstream
endobj
