(1. Bidder must comply with statutory labor laws including EPFO and ESIC registrations where applicable.) '
(2. Site installation, erection and commissioning requires mandatory EPFO establishment code and ESIC compliance without arrears.) '
(3. All contractor workmen engaged in refinery premises must possess active UAN and ESIC coverage.) '
(4. Non-compliance with EPFO or ESIC statutory contributions shall lead to technical rejection for site scope.) '
ET

