(SECTION IV - MAKE IN INDIA \(PPP-MII\) & MSME POLICY) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 720 Td
20 TL
(1. Preference to Make in India Policy: Only Class-I Local Suppliers with local content not less than 50% are eligible to participate.) '
(2. Bidder shall furnish Make-in-India Self-Certification Affidavit indicating percentage of domestic value addition.) '
(3. Participating Micro and Small Enterprises holding valid Udyam Registration Certificate will receive purchase preference as per PPP-MSE Order.) '
(4. Startups recognized by DPIIT are exempted from prior turnover and experience criteria subject to meeting quality standards.) '
ET

