ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 720 Td
20 TL
(1. The manufacturer must hold valid ISO 9001:2015 quality management system certification from an accredited agency.) '
(2. In case of non-OEM bidders, tender-specific authorization certificate from OEM \(Manufacturer Authorization Form - MAF\) must be submitted.) '
(3. Valves must comply with API 6D pipeline valve specification and ASME B16.34 hydrostatic testing standards.) '
(4. Mandatory Documents to be uploaded: PAN Card, GST Registration Certificate \(REG-06\), Udyam Certificate, Make-in-India Self-Certification Affidavit, ISO 9001 Certificate, OEM Authorization Form, Audited Turnover Certificate.) '
ET

